# Keep build context minimal. Only `scirocco/` is COPYed by the Dockerfile.
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.github
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/*.swp
**/.DS_Store

# Build artifacts
**/build
**/build-*
**/cmake-build-*
**/_deps
**/CMakeFiles
**/CMakeCache.txt
**/*.o
**/*.a
**/*.so
**/*.dylib

# Docs and examples are not needed in the image
docs
examples
mfoil

# Python/venv junk
**/__pycache__
**/.venv
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/*.egg-info

# Local notes / plans
**/*.local
**/CLAUDE.md
**/AGENTS.md
**/AGENTS.local.md
**/CLAUDE.local.md
